      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are these secrets large enough to be deduplicated at 128 byes? I think it depends on the size of self.context and self.start_mark? if thare small then this may fit in under 128 bytes anyway?\n\nMaybe a good check is to check the size of the secret falls between 128 and 1024 bytes somewhere below to ensure we\u0027re testing what we think we\u0027re testing?",
